oregon.gov">franki.allegra@oprd.oregon.gov</a>&gt;<br>
<b>Subject:</b> Re: September</span> <o:p></o:p></p>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">If this would hurt me in any way, I will stay. I jus=
t want to be perfectly clear about that. I bring it up now because I'm plan=
ning my movements and there are seven months before this assignment, so I t=
rust I wouldn't inconvenience you
 - the timing, like everything, is a variable in my contemplations. I would=
 stay, joyfully, not as a concession, as total acceptance of alignment. I m=
ake this plea because I don't have assignments for July and August but that=
 time is too short for me to go
 to Kentucky and back, and I couldn't go after September because our parks =
close for the winter. I just don't see a clear way to make this puzzle work=
 - but staying is one way, and perhaps going to Kentucky in the spring. Aft=
er April, when I finish at Honeyman
 that season. I hope you see I'm trying here. I will stay if breaking my co=
mmitment would cause disharmony.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div class=3D"MsoNormal" align=3D"center" style=3D"text-align:center">
<hr size=3D"2" width=3D"98%" align=3D"center">
</div>
<div id=3D"x_x_x_divRplyFwdMsg">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot=
;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black">From:</span></b><span style=3D"font-=
size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black"> Robert=
 Samuel White<br>
<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, February 6, 2025 7:15:49 PM<br>
<b>To:</b> ALLEGRA Franki * OPRD &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:franki.allegra@oprd.=
oregon.gov">franki.allegra@oprd.oregon.gov</a>&gt;<br>
<b>Subject:</b> September</span> <o:p></o:p></p>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Hi, Franki.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I have a predicament.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">On one hand, I want to establish a reliable relation=
ship with you. I want you to know I'm dependable and you can count on me. T=
his is really important to me.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">On the other hand, I really need to go home to Kentu=
cky at some point. It is very likely the last time I will ever see my mothe=
r. This is really important to me too.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I was going to go this summer, but I couldn't turn d=
own the Humbug position. Not only is it my favorite place on earth (literal=
ly), I get to experience it with the bustling summer activity of the coast!=
<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">And I was looking forward to the same kind of experi=
ence at Tugman in September, when the park is likely quite busy and active =
and I'd be responsible for greeting new visitors as relief host.<o:p></o:p>=
</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I really can't tell you how much it meant to me you =
extended the offer to me and I want more than anything to do it. But I have=
 a problem...<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I started making plans to go home this winter and re=
membered why I came to Oregon in the first place: winters are harsh in Kent=
ucky and the parks are closed. I literally can't travel there then.<o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">After Umpqua in April, I spend two months at Humbug.=
 I'd like to go home after that. But this means backing out of my September=
 assignment at Tugman.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I know that you would accept this. But I need more t=
han that from you. I need to know you understand how torn I feel about it a=
nd that it's not a reflection of my future reliability or passion for worki=
ng with you at your parks. And I need
 to know this won't hurt me - as you know I already backed out of the very =
dumb decision to go to a day use area away from the coast, and I have no id=
ea how that information appears in your systems.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I'm trying to build a new life here, but my old life=
 has some loose ends I need to confront. Can you help me?<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Sam<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
